Package: microhaplot
Type: Package
Title: Microhaplotype Constructor and Visualizer
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Thomas", "Ng", email = "tngthomasng@gmail.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Loïc", "Talignani", email = "loic.talignani@ird.fr", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: A server-side Shiny application to construct and curate
    microhaplotypes from indexed BAM alignments. Replaces the original
    Perl-based pipeline with a pure-R extraction engine (Rsamtools).
    Designed for deployment on the SKAT3 IRD infrastructure but can also
    be run locally.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
License: GPL-3
LazyData: FALSE
